  "body": "## New Features\r\n- add support for OSC52 clipboard codes ([#1280](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1280))\r\n- abandon support for lingyiwanwu client ([#1327](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1327))\r\n- support autodetecting dark/light theme ([#1335](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1335))\r\n- enhence `.regenerate` ([#1340](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1340))\r\n- ctrl+j for newline ([#1342](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1342))\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n- use_tools in agent mode ([#1252](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1252))\r\n- visual indication of Vi insert/normal model ([#1279](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1279))\r\n- better error handling for `aichat -e` on MacOS ([#1311](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1311))\r\n- openai api omits content field from tool_calls message ([#1326](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1326))\r\n- change temperature/top_p reading rules ([#1333](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1333))\r\n- `.file` external commands capture stdout/stderr ([#1343](https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1343))\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @laktak made their first contribution in https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1279\r\n* @gcv made their first contribution in https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/pull/1280\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sigoden/aichat/compare/v0.29.0...v0.30.0",
